From 59a539b72c61211818af261fc6aab9877dbf5cd1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tudor Timi <tudortimi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Aug 2021 19:54:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] Fix 'sim_8' test

It's intention was probably to check the handling of file lists.

It's probably not important that the unit test get created every time,
but this is what the original test did. If this is the case, we don't
need to store the unit test in the repo.

Since we compile 'another_filelist_module.sv' through 'a_filelist.f', we
don't need to specify it in 'svunit.f'.
